meta {
  name: Claim juz (self)
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/khatm/groups/:groupId/juz/:juzNumber/claim
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  groupId: uuid
  juzNumber: 1-30
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Replaces: claim_juz RPC (security-audit fix SA-003).

  Authorization: JOINED member of the group; group assignment_mode must be
  PARTICIPANT.

  CRITICAL: the claiming participant is derived from the authenticated user +
  group server-side. There is deliberately NO participant_id in this request
  — accepting one would let a member claim on someone else's behalf
  (the exact bug SA-003 fixed).

  Responses:
  - 201 assignment object (status ASSIGNED, progress 0)
  - 409 "This Juz already has the maximum number of assignees." / already
    claimed by caller

  Audit: JUZ_ASSIGNED (self-claim).
}
